---
import Sheet from '../layouts/Sheet.astro';
---

<Sheet
  title="Privacy Policy | SkyKPI"
  description="SkyKPI collects only what the contact form sends, sells no data, and sets no tracking cookies. The full policy, in plain language."
  path="/privacy/"
  sheet="G-001"
  sheetName="Privacy"
>
  <section class="section sheet-dark privacy">
    <div class="container privacy__inner">
      <p class="tag">Sheet G-001 &middot; General / Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <hr class="dimline" aria-hidden="true" />
      <p class="lede">
        The short version: we collect only what you send us through the
        contact form, we do not sell data, and this site sets no tracking
        cookies.
      </p>

      <div class="privacy__body">
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          If you submit the contact form, we receive what you typed: your
          name, company or association, email address, and message. That is
          the only information this site collects about you.
        </p>

        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <p>
          We use it to reply to you and to carry on the conversation you
          started. We do not add you to a mailing list, share your
          information, or sell it to anyone.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
        <p>
          This site sets no cookies and runs no tracking or analytics
          scripts. If we ever add analytics, it will be a cookieless,
          server-side kind that does not identify you, and this policy will
          say so before it happens.
        </p>

        <h2>Where the form data lives</h2>
        <p>
          The site is hosted on Netlify, which processes form submissions and
          standard server logs on our behalf. Form submissions are forwarded
          to our email and stored in Netlify's form dashboard.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          If you want a copy of what you sent us, or want it deleted, email
          <a href="mailto:hello@skykpi.com">hello@skykpi.com</a> and we will
          take care of it.
        </p>

        <p class="privacy__issued tag tag--dim">Issued 2026. Supersedes all previous revisions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Sheet>

<style>
  .privacy {
    padding-top: calc(var(--header-h) + var(--space-section));
  }

  .privacy__inner {
    max-width: 42rem;
  }

  .privacy__body {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .privacy__body h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin: 2.25rem 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .privacy__body a {
    color: var(--teal);
  }

  .privacy__issued {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }
</style>
